ute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H4057"},{"id":"psalms-102-7-3","surface":"הָ֝יִ֗יתִי","lemma":"הָיָה","translit":"hayiytiy","morph":"Verb Qal Participle 1st common singular","glosses":[],"strongs":"H1961"},{"id":"psalms-102-7-4","surface":"כְּכ֣וֹס","lemma":"כּוֹס","translit":"kekvos","morph":"Preposition + Noun common masculine singular construct","glosses":[],"strongs":"H3563"},{"id":"psalms-102-7-5","surface":"חֳרָבֽוֹת","lemma":"חׇרְבָּה","translit":"chrabvot","morph":"Noun common feminine plural absolute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H2723"}],"language":"hebrew"},{"ref":"Psalms 102:8","englishText":"My enemies reproach me all day. Those who are mad at me use my name as a curse. ","tokens":[{"id":"psalms-102-8-0","surface":"שָׁקַ֥דְתִּי","lemma":"שָׁקַד","translit":"shaqadetiy","morph":"Verb Qal Participle 1st common singular","glosses":[],"strongs":"H8245"},{"id":"psalms-102-8-1","surface":"וָאֶֽהְיֶ֑ה","lemma":"הָיָה","translit":"va'eheyeh","morph":"Conjunction + Verb Qal Wayyiqtol 1st common singular","glosses":[],"strongs":"H1961"},{"id":"psalms-102-8-2","surface":"כְּ֝צִפּ֗וֹר","lemma":"צִפּוֹר","translit":"ketsipvor","morph":"Preposition + Noun common singular absolute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H6833"},{"id":"psalms-102-8-3","surface":"בּוֹדֵ֥ד","lemma":"בָּדַד","translit":"bvoded","morph":"Verb Qal Passive Participle","glosses":[],"strongs":"H909"},{"id":"psalms-102-8-4","surface":"עַל","lemma":"עַל","translit":"`al","morph":"Preposition","glosses":[],"strongs":"H5921"},{"id":"psalms-102-8-5","surface":"גָּֽג","lemma":"גָּג","translit":"gag","morph":"Noun common masculine singular absolute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H1406"}],"language":"hebrew"},{"ref":"Psalms 102:9","englishText":"For I have eaten ashes like bread, and mixed my drink with tears, ","tokens":[{"id":"psalms-102-9-0","surface":"כָּל","lemma":"כֹּל","translit":"kal","morph":"Noun common masculine singular construct","glosses":[],"strongs":"H3605"},{"id":"psalms-102-9-1","surface":"הַ֭יּוֹם","lemma":"יוֹ